  "name": "Cheesy Sausage Pasta",
  "subtitle": "Shell pasta with creamy tomato sauce and Italian sausage",
  "description": "A hearty skillet pasta combining browned sausage, tender peppers, creamy tomatoes, Parmesan, and parsley.",
